<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Household Intl raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Household Intl raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns upgraded Household International Inc to buy from attractive, the office of analyst David Hochstim confirmed.</p>
<p>-- Analyst not available to provide further details.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1-3/4 to 119.</p>
</text>
